# ⚠ Wire captures stay ignored by default.  A capture of a real launch monitor
# carries the peer's IP address and its DeviceID string, which together can
# identify a specific installation.  Fixtures are tracked one by one under
# tests/fixtures/ after checking each is redacted.
*.gswire
!tests/fixtures/*.gswire

# Claude-specific artefacts stay local, as in libwrist and PinPoint Studio:
# notes and skills are working material rather than a contract, and
# settings.local.json is per-machine permission state.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
